                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr.
                            Stevens.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 22.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-04-07"><hi rendition="#italic">April 7,
                        1890</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    Nos. 4–19.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James G. Blaine.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
